cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Solr/Lucene Migration Correctness Harness"
authors:
  - family-names: Saini
    given-names: Parveen
repository-code: https://github.com/parveensaini/solr-lucene-migration-correctness
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-06-01
abstract: >
  A runnable harness and checklist for validating Solr/Lucene major-version upgrades in ranking- and ML-critical systems. Quantifies semantic drift, rank churn, score drift, and migration risk using candidate overlap, RBO, rank deltas, and score distribution comparisons across Solr 5, 8, 9, and 10 version pairs.
